From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RobertGarciaa <chae0218@naver.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 14:30:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Diagnose GetModelRequest header presence

Log GetModelRequest header key presence and the model URL host for
code=4 diagnosis. Pre-filter states (put mapId key=null/empty/present)
are logged at the header filter point; post-filter key set with the same
mapId plus per-key missing/null/empty/present are logged at return.
Map identityHashCode links both sides; no raw values, no map toString.
Font path has no dedicated instrumentation (shared-helper logs may appear).
Temporary diagnostic patch, remove before final distribution.

Signed-off-by: RobertGarciaa <chae0218@naver.com>
---
